@startuml use_case_diagram

left to right direction

actor User

rectangle "GitHub Workflow Manager" {

  package "Interactive Mode" {
    usecase "Launch interactive menu"  as UI
    usecase "Add workflow run"         as I_ADD
    usecase "List all runs"            as I_LIST
    usecase "Get run detail"           as I_DETAIL
    usecase "Filter runs"              as I_FILTER
    usecase "Filter by branch"         as I_FBRANCH
    usecase "Filter by status"         as I_FSTATUS
    usecase "Filter by conclusion"     as I_FCONCL
    usecase "Exit application"         as I_EXIT
  }

  package "Command-line Mode" {
    usecase "Run one-shot CLI command" as CLI
    usecase "Add workflow run"         as C_ADD
    usecase "List runs"                as C_LIST
    usecase "Filter by branch"         as C_FBRANCH
    usecase "Filter by status"         as C_FSTATUS
    usecase "Filter by conclusion"     as C_FCONCL
    usecase "Get run detail"           as C_DETAIL
  }

  package "GUI Mode" {
    usecase "Launch workflow GUI"      as GUI
    usecase "View workflow runs"       as G_VIEW
    usecase "Filter runs"              as G_FILTER
    usecase "Filter by branch"         as G_FBRANCH
    usecase "Filter by status"         as G_FSTATUS
    usecase "Filter by conclusion"     as G_FCONCL
    usecase "View run details"         as G_DETAIL
  }
}

User --> UI
User --> CLI
User --> GUI

UI --> I_ADD
UI --> I_LIST
UI --> I_DETAIL
UI --> I_FILTER
UI --> I_EXIT

I_FILTER --> I_FBRANCH  : <<extend>>
I_FILTER --> I_FSTATUS  : <<extend>>
I_FILTER --> I_FCONCL   : <<extend>>

CLI --> C_ADD
CLI --> C_LIST
CLI --> C_DETAIL

C_LIST --> C_FBRANCH  : <<extend>>
C_LIST --> C_FSTATUS  : <<extend>>
C_LIST --> C_FCONCL   : <<extend>>

GUI --> G_VIEW
GUI --> G_DETAIL

G_VIEW --> G_FILTER
G_FILTER --> G_FBRANCH  : <<extend>>
G_FILTER --> G_FSTATUS  : <<extend>>
G_FILTER --> G_FCONCL   : <<extend>>

@enduml
